From 17b3143327b39acaa09a4e9e05db4c4b7b6936e1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kostiantyn Andriiuk <konstantin@andriyuk.com>
Date: Sun, 13 Sep 2026 16:21:18 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 46/49] media: onclite: add opt-in fixed-mode OV12A10 first
 light

Reuse the public vince one-mode driver, checking selected stock tables.

Use onclite capture power with tracked partial unwind and restoration.

Register OFF. Start only explicitly; synchronous stop and fault latch.

Keep controls read-only; no new AE, digital gain, AF or OTP accesses.

Signed-off-by: Kostiantyn Andriiuk <konstantin@andriyuk.com>
---
