+/*
+ * Opt-in, fixed-mode OV12A10 first-light driver for Xiaomi onclite.
+ * Based on the public GPL vince one-mode driver by Kostiantyn Andriiuk.
+ * Selected stock init differences privately checked; no original blob/code
+ * redistributed. Link/external HTS derived from descriptor, not measured.
+ * No AE/gain/long-exposure, AF, EEPROM, OTP or flash controls.
+ */
